Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b8,n35,"v8 = 'No'") -> action(n35,"Non compliance resolved"); source=i9:After that, the invoice is paid and if it is returned, non-compliance is resolved.; reason=The source strictly ties non-compliance resolution to the invoice being returned (positive branch). The model incorrectly assigns this resolution to the negative branch (v8='No'), inverting the specified condition.
